WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.300
A report reads eight pages. Which eight?

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.000
The plan set the cap and not the rule.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.900
Rank by confidence and look what you get.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.400
One fact, five times.

5
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.200
So spend the cap on different questions.

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.200
Six answered beats one answered six times.

7
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.200
And guess before you search.

8
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.100
Only a company own page can set a number.

9
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.000
Running it found what fixtures could not.

10
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.800
One page was taking two of eight slots.

11
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.700
And a book chapter became a feature page.

12
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.000
Short paths are names. Long ones are articles.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Six sources, five questions.

14
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Sixteen paths tried, so thin is checkable.

15
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Next: read them.
